        <mxCell id="meta-label" parent="1" style="text;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=3;verticalAlign=top;rounded=1" value="strace captures per openat():&#xa;• file path (read or write)&#xa;• process ID&#xa;• flags (O_RDONLY, O_WRONLY)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="145" x="48" y="446" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stracelog" parent="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top" value="strace_java_logfile (text)&#xa;&#xa;One line per openat() syscall:&#xa;pid openat(AT_FDCWD, &quot;/path/to/file&quot;, flags)&#xa;&#xa;Example: javac reads Main.java&#xa;12345 openat(AT_FDCWD, &quot;src/Main.java&quot;, O_RDONLY) = 3&#xa;&#xa;Example: jar writes app.jar&#xa;12345 openat(AT_FDCWD, &quot;target/app.jar&quot;, O_WRONLY|...) = 4" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="122" width="270" x="40" y="590" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bomsh-py" parent="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top" value="bomsh_create_bom_java.py&#xa;(Python script)&#xa;&#xa;Post-build analysis:&#xa;Scans build tree for .java/.class/.jar&#xa;builds dependency graph" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="87" width="165" x="350" y="605" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="treedb" parent="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top" value="bomsh_omnibor_treedb&#xa;(JSON file)&#xa;&#xa;{ &quot;gitoid:sha256:abc123...&quot;:&#xa;    &quot;/repo/src/Main.java&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;gitoid:sha256:def456...&quot;:&#xa;    &quot;/repo/target/Main.class&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;gitoid:sha256:789...&quot;:&#xa;    &quot;/repo/target/app.jar&quot;, ... }" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="102" width="175" x="561" y="520" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="adg" parent="1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=8;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top" value="ADG (.omnibor/ directory)&#xa;&#xa;One file per output artifact:&#xa;gitoid:sha256:&lt;jar_hash&gt;&#xa;├─ blob &lt;Main.class_hash&gt;&#xa;├─ blob &lt;Util.class_hash&gt;&#xa;└─ blob &lt;resource_hash&gt;&#xa;&#xa;Maps: .jar → all .class + resources" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="107" width="175" x="561" y="641" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c2" edge="1" parent="1" source="stracelog" target="bomsh-py">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3" edge="1" parent="1" source="bomsh-py" style="exitX=0.984;exitY=0.12;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;" target="treedb">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="530" y="620" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c4" edge="1" parent="1" source="bomsh-py" style="exitX=1;exitY=0.75;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;" target="adg">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="520" y="702" as="sourcePoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap" value="SECTION 2 DATA FLOW (Java-specific):&#xa;1. strace spawns orchestrator as child process&#xa;2. strace intercepts every openat() syscall (file I/O)&#xa;3. Records: which files read? which files written?&#xa;4. After build: bomsh_create_bom_java.py runs:&#xa;   • Scans build tree for .java, .class, .jar files&#xa;   • Computes SHA-256 hash (gitoid) of each&#xa;   • Builds dependency graph: .java → .class → .jar&#xa;   • Writes bomsh_omnibor_treedb (JSON)&#xa;   • Writes ADG files (.omnibor/ directory)&#xa;&#xa;Key difference from C/C++:&#xa;• C/C++ uses bomtrace3 + ptrace(execve)&#xa;• Java uses strace + openat() (post-build)&#xa;&#xa;strace options: -f -s99999 --seccomp-bpf -e trace=openat" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="240" x="773" y="510" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="div2" parent="1" style="line;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#1D1D1D;dashed=1" value="" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="10" width="980" x="40" y="770" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1" value="Section 3: omnibor-analysis — SPDX Generation from ADG (Java)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="25" width="550" x="40" y="790" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
