          <mxGeometry height="100" width="250" x="767" y="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3-note" parent="1" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#e0e0e0;strokeColor=#9e9e9e;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=5;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontStyle=0" value="SECTION 3 DATA FLOW (Java-specific):&#xa;1. AdgParser reads treedb, resolves gitoid → file path&#xa;   Output: source_files[] (.java paths, test excluded)&#xa;&#xa;2. mvn dependency:tree resolves full Maven graph&#xa;   Filters: compile/runtime/provided scopes only&#xa;   Excludes: test-scope dependencies&#xa;   Output: maven_deps[] with direct/transitive flags&#xa;&#xa;3. get_jar_source_files() maps .class → .java&#xa;   Per-JAR filtering for multi-module projects&#xa;&#xa;4. JavaSpdxGenerator combines all inputs into&#xa;   SPDX 2.3 JSON with packages + relationships&#xa;   • Root JAR DEPENDS_ON direct deps&#xa;   • Direct deps DEPENDS_ON transitive deps&#xa;   • PROVIDED scope → BUILD_TOOL_OF&#xa;   • Source files CONTAINED_BY root JAR&#xa;&#xa;5. spdx_visualize.py generates interactive D3.js&#xa;   graph with direct/transitive/sibling coloring" vertex="1">
